{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-db7d1df9f614892dafcf87e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.248407+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "db7d1df9f614892dafcf87e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "db7d1df9f614892dafcf87e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: OMG! Toby looks so adorable! Congrats on your new addition. I'm sure you're really happy right now! I so happy for you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-7f2305377c4456b4d7d61f90", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.276513+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7f2305377c4456b4d7d61f90", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7f2305377c4456b4d7d61f90", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Haha yeah! Toby's definitely bringing a lot of joy. Since we last talked, work has been piling up and I've been stuck inside. I miss the peace and feeling of freedom that comes with going for a hike."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-d860560edda351f6f7bc001f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.288369+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d860560edda351f6f7bc001f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d860560edda351f6f7bc001f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah you're really stressed then! When work's non-stop, it's hard to get outdoors. Hiking is a great way to relax and take in nature. Do you have plans to go hiking soon? We should plan a trip for both of us and our pups!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-97d24e62784e1301a56269fc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.308418+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "97d24e62784e1301a56269fc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "97d24e62784e1301a56269fc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yeah work's been stressful lately and I need a break. I have plans for a hike next month and thought it'd be cool if you and the pups could come along. We can enjoy nature and have a fun time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-7335868b8533a49c1c963982", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.317706+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7335868b8533a49c1c963982", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7335868b8533a49c1c963982", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Sounds great! I'm in for the hike, and my dogs can come too. Thanks for inviting us! I made these personalized tags for them. Take a look!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-e8da0a3ffc9c6d6cd6cf7a0c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.338584+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8da0a3ffc9c6d6cd6cf7a0c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8da0a3ffc9c6d6cd6cf7a0c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Wow, those look great! Did you make them? It's really cool!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-8acb6fe87c02c1055ac286af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.348370+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8acb6fe87c02c1055ac286af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8acb6fe87c02c1055ac286af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Thanks! Yeah, I made them myself. I wanted each one to be special and fit their personalities."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-261a43cb2fc8c688a1539c3a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.363741+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "261a43cb2fc8c688a1539c3a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "261a43cb2fc8c688a1539c3a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Wow, that's so cool. You really put so much love into making them, which makes them extra special."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-4c8804b8a54a25c8317a5112", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.375259+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c8804b8a54a25c8317a5112", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c8804b8a54a25c8317a5112", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Thanks! I did put a lot of love into making these tags. I want my pets to feel seen and loved."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-e735cc73142f62828a98fb33", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.387393+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e735cc73142f62828a98fb33", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e735cc73142f62828a98fb33", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: It really are the small things like these show we care a ton about out pets."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-0c1f36d4da977ef389aa6eac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.398802+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c1f36d4da977ef389aa6eac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c1f36d4da977ef389aa6eac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yep! Small acts of love like that make a big difference in our relationships with our furry pals. Let's make sure they know how much we care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-faa8a34356eb5037ce0229d0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.409363+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "faa8a34356eb5037ce0229d0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "faa8a34356eb5037ce0229d0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Definitely! They bring us so much joy, so it's only fair that we show them how special they are. Can't wait for our hike - and for Toby and your pups to meet!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-d2d2125ce07744a75b2570e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.424365+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d2d2125ce07744a75b2570e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d2d2125ce07744a75b2570e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Can't wait either! It's going to be loads of fun and a great memory."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-205b0ab8dc78e3566a1b1595", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.438857+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "205b0ab8dc78e3566a1b1595", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "205b0ab8dc78e3566a1b1595", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yep! It'll be an adventure alright."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-520827e4eeca1282ff1ce768", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.451977+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "520827e4eeca1282ff1ce768", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "520827e4eeca1282ff1ce768", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Counting down the days 'til our hike! Gotta get them ready soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-980854a6de91664ea8e1713a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.469268+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "980854a6de91664ea8e1713a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "980854a6de91664ea8e1713a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Same here! It's gonna be awesome. Let's talk later k?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_12-42ae0dbca91e96a523eb2957", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:56.480847+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "42ae0dbca91e96a523eb2957", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "42ae0dbca91e96a523eb2957", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
